ataset_stats":{"total":2896,"recent":2854,"review":1346},"items":[{"title":"X2Real","published":"2026-09-23","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","routes":["R11","R7"],"primary_route":"R11","institution":"自变量机器人","region":"国内","contribution":"校准仿真与实机并隔离训练评测流程","hardware":"Isaac Lab-Arena / 操作机器人","data_scale":"近300小时仿真轨迹","evaluation":"44任务、10维能力；仿真/实机分数相关0.84","evidence":["paper"],"kind":"论文","verified":true,"updated":"2026-10-13","review":false,"confidence":1,"classification_method":"human","id":"arxiv:2609.27449","sources":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449"],"first_seen":"2026-10-25T04:14:20+00:00","change":null,"weekly_citations":null,"weekly_stars":null,"weekly_attention":null,"abstract":"Generalist robot manipulation policies have developed rapidly, yet their reliable evaluation remains challenging due to fundamental flaws in existing simulation benchmarks: prominent sim-to-real gaps, narrow task coverage, and unfair evaluation caused by ambiguous training-test pipelines. Prior works only partially resolve these issues and lack simultaneous faithfulness, diversity, and fairness, while static benchmark designs fail to sustain long-term policy development. We present X2Real, an evolvable simulation benchmark for faithfully evaluating the real-world performance of robotic manipulation policies based on Nvidia Isaac Lab-Arena. Following three core principles (faithfulness, diversity, and fairness), X2Real calibrates simulation visual and physical properties to align with real hardware, achieving a 0.84 linear correlation between simulated and real-robot evaluation results. It features a comprehensive taxonomy with 10 capability dimensions and 44 hierarchical long-horizon tasks, covering basic manipulation skills and advanced capacities such as visual grounding, language understanding, and bimanual control. We further adopt multi-axis domain randomization and strictly disjoint training-evaluation pipelines to mitigate benchmark exploitation and ensure credible evaluation. Powered by a custom physical domain-specific language, the Mana simulation ecosystem supports modular task design and iterative performance analysis, alongside a nearly 300-hour annotated simulation trajectory dataset. X2Real offers a faithful, diverse, and fair evolving evaluation infrastructure, effectively bridging the sim-to-real evaluation gap and supporting the advancement of generalist robotic manipulation policies.","authors":["Lian Ruan","Jade Yang","Sherphylan Gao","Felix Gao","Kyson Liang","Galen Liu","Ligo Wu","Lane Jin","Guu Gu","Bevan Xie","Cloud Yan","Zongzi Yuan","Kino Luo","Emma Chen","Shuwen Chen","Yang Ping","Miles Guo","Rain Sun","Kayden Zhang","Alex Du","Ruihai Wu","Liang Hao","Zhaoshuo Li","Roy Gan","Hao Wang","Qian Wang"],"field_evidence":{"contribution":{"value":"校准仿真与实机并隔离训练评测流程","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"routes":{"value":["R11","R7"],"status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"institution":{"value":"自变量机器人","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"region":{"value":"国内","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"hardware":{"value":"Isaac Lab-Arena / 操作机器人","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"data_scale":{"value":"近300小时仿真轨迹","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"},"evaluation":{"value":"44任务、10维能力；仿真/实机分数相关0.84","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:39+00:00"}},"review_reasons":[],"coverage":{"supported":7,"total":7},"missing_fields":[],"arxiv_version_url":"http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.27449v2","author_affiliations":[],"extraction":{"version":3,"paper_updated":"2026-10-13","attempted_at":"2026-10-25T10:10:20+00:00","status":"complete","document_count":1,"llm_used":false,"sources":[{"url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2609.27449v2","format":"html","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T10:10:23+00:00"}],"errors":[{"url":"https://x2robot.com/en/pages/x2real","error":"ValueError"}]},"author_linked_sources":["https://github.com/X-Square-Robot/x2real","https://x2robot.com/en/pages/x2real"],"resource_evidence":{"code":{"kind":"code","url":"https://github.com/X-Square-Robot/x2real","status":"supported","quote":"Public non-empty repository; languages: Python, Kit, Shell","license":"Apache-2.0","github":"X-Square-Robot/x2real","checked_at":"2026-10-25T10:10:24+00:00"}},"github":"X-Square-Robot/x2real","license":"Apache-2.0","detail_key":"0e36f72e31a23f156f5c3013"},{"title":"Helix 2.5","published":"2026-09-17","url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","routes":["R3","R7","R8","R10"],"primary_route":"R3","institution":"Figure","region":"海外","contribution":"人类视频预训练迁移到未见家庭全身操作","hardware":"Figure 人形","data_scale":"Index；任务专用数据未核验","evaluation":"30未见家庭/3行为；官方消融9→56%，非第三方","evidence":["report","demo"],"kind":"官方技术长文","verified":true,"review":false,"confidence":1,"classification_method":"human","id":"url:d12ee081a0882850371d","sources":["https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization"],"first_seen":"2026-10-25T04:14:20+00:00","change":null,"weekly_citations":null,"weekly_stars":null,"weekly_attention":null,"field_evidence":{"contribution":{"value":"人类视频预训练迁移到未见家庭全身操作","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"routes":{"value":["R3","R7","R8","R10"],"status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"institution":{"value":"Figure","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"region":{"value":"海外","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"hardware":{"value":"Figure 人形","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"data_scale":{"value":"Index；任务专用数据未核验","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"evaluation":{"value":"30未见家庭/3行为；官方消融9→56%，非第三方","status":"human","source_url":"https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-2-5-zero-shot-30-home-generalization","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"}},"review_reasons":[],"coverage":{"supported":7,"total":7},"missing_fields":[],"detail_key":"d90c1e05937281d6d921ae6e"},{"title":"GE-Act 2.0","published":"2026-09-04","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","routes":["R4","R7"],"primary_route":"R4","institution":"智元 AgiBot","region":"国内","contribution":"控制导向压缩、单步视觉规划与逆动力学联合训练","hardware":"G1-OP / G2-90D","data_scale":"300→30000小时","evaluation":"作者报告100任务/20技能组；G1-OP17.1→44.1%","evidence":["paper","report"],"kind":"技术报告","verified":true,"updated":"2026-10-09","sources":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","https://ge-act-v2.github.io/"],"review":false,"confidence":1,"classification_method":"human","id":"arxiv:2609.05588","first_seen":"2026-10-25T04:14:20+00:00","change":null,"weekly_citations":null,"weekly_stars":null,"weekly_attention":null,"abstract":"World-action models (WAM) predict future states to guide robot actions, enabling learning from both action-free video and action-labeled interaction. Most inherit pretrained video generators, leaving WAM pretraining and scaling underexplored. We introduce Genie Envisioner Act 2.0 (GE-Act 2.0), a world-action model whose trainable generative and action components are all initialized from scratch on manipulation data. It combines a control-oriented autoencoder (CoAE), a single-step visual planner (SVP), and an inverse dynamics model (IDM). CoAE retains action- and instruction-relevant information under aggressive compression, while SVP produces a complete future state in one differentiable pass, so visual planning and inverse dynamics can be pretrained separately on complementary data. The components are then jointly trained with knowledge-aligned selective optimization (KASO), which reduces mismatched supervision by selecting only predicted futures judged behaviorally compatible with the recorded action. We evaluate pretrained checkpoints directly, without per-task fine-tuning, on 100 tasks across 20 manipulation skill groups with held-out scenes, backgrounds, lighting, and object instances. Scaling co-training data from 300 to 30,000 hours raises success from 17.1% to 44.1% on G1-OP and from 13.4% to 31.1% on G2-90D; despite comprising less than 2% of the co-training data, G2-90D improves by 17.7 points, suggesting cross-embodiment transfer. Gains span 19/20 and 18/20 skill groups, and skill-specific coverage strongly correlates with zero-shot out-of-distribution (OOD) success (Pearson r=0.80; Spearman rho=0.85). Under the same protocol, the model grounds object, color, shape, and position references in at least 90% of trials and follows explicit instructions even when they conflict with an already-committed behavior or a conventional scene association.","authors":["Renhang Liu","Wenzhi Zhao","Zhuo Yang","Liliang Chen","Pengfei Zhou","Shengcong Chen","Guanghui Ren","Youlun Peng","Rongjun Jin","Nan Wang","Sukai Wang","Xindong He","Jinyuan Feng","Ziyu Xiong","Linqing Zhong","Yifei Wei","Feng Han","Long Zhang","Da Huang","Nanshu Zhao","Chenghao Yin","Mo Wu","Zhaodong Yan","Kongtao Hu","Yuxiang Yan","Aogelijiang Niyazi","Yu Fang","Jia Zeng","Lizhu Meng","Daizhen Lv","Haoyu Cao","Zhiwen Hou","Lianjin Ye","Yuehan Niu","Zhikai Cai","Xuan Hu","Hui Min","Xiongfeng Cai","Yue Liao","Jing Wu","Soujanya Poria","Ye Li","Sanping Zhou","Maoqing Yao","AgiBot Research Team"],"field_evidence":{"contribution":{"value":"控制导向压缩、单步视觉规划与逆动力学联合训练","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"routes":{"value":["R4","R7"],"status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"institution":{"value":"智元 AgiBot","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"region":{"value":"国内","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"hardware":{"value":"G1-OP / G2-90D","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"data_scale":{"value":"300→30000小时","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"},"evaluation":{"value":"作者报告100任务/20技能组；G1-OP17.1→44.1%","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:40+00:00"}},"review_reasons":[],"coverage":{"supported":7,"total":7},"missing_fields":[],"extraction":{"version":3,"paper_updated":"2026-10-09","attempted_at":"2026-10-25T05:59:14+00:00","status":"complete","document_count":2,"llm_used":false,"sources":[{"url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2609.05588","format":"html","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T05:59:17+00:00"},{"url":"https://ge-act-v2.github.io/","format":"html","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T05:59:18+00:00"}],"errors":[]},"author_linked_sources":["https://ge-act-v2.github.io/"],"affiliation_source_text":"Affiliation: https://ge-act-v2.github.io/","arxiv_version_url":"http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05588v2","author_affiliations":[],"detail_key":"9e4ff0ff4918d4fa706da509"},{"title":"G0.5","published":"2026-08-12","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","routes":["R1","R5","R10"],"primary_route":"R1","institution":"星海图 Galaxea","region":"国内","contribution":"统一自回归流输出推理与动作 token","hardware":"R1-Lite / R1-Pro","data_scale":"机器人数据与VQA混合，规模未核验","evaluation":"作者同协议：真实微调76.7%；LIBERO98.9%","evidence":["paper"],"kind":"论文","verified":true,"sources":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","https://opengalaxea.github.io/G05/"],"review":false,"confidence":1,"classification_method":"human","id":"arxiv:2608.11739","first_seen":"2026-10-25T04:14:20+00:00","change":null,"weekly_citations":null,"weekly_stars":null,"weekly_attention":null,"updated":"2026-08-12T07:26:47Z","abstract":"The prevailing recipe for Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models couples a pretrained VLM with a separately trained flow-matching action expert. This makes the VLM a context encoder rather than a decision-maker. We introduce G0.5, a pretrained autoregressive VLA in which a single transformer decoder emits reasoning and action tokens under a single objective. Three components make this tractable at foundation-model scale: a learnable cross-embodiment action tokenizer that maps heterogeneous robot actions into a shared vocabulary; a native chain-of-thought stream interleaving task decomposition, object grounding, and action hints with action tokens; and a visual memory module that injects multi-second history through the vision encoder. Because reasoning and action share a single set of weights, the pretrained VLM's capabilities carry over to physical behavior: the model follows instructions closely, and prompts directly steer action granularity, task horizon, and out-of-distribution scene handling without further training. Pretrained on a large collection of robot datasets together with VQA samples, G0.5 surpasses state-of-the-art models across 7 independent regimes: real-world fine-tuning on R1lite and R1pro robots (76.7\\% vs.\\ 53.3\\% for $π_{0.5}$ and 24.4\\% for GR00T-N1.7), the 2025 BEHAVIOR Challenge on 50 long-horizon household mobile manipulation tasks using a generalist policy (31.4\\% vs.\\ 26.3\\% for $π_{0.5}$ and 26.1\\% for the challenge winner), DROID post-training followed by zero-shot transfer to an unseen environment and objects (82.5\\%), a language-following Pick-and-Place benchmark, LIBERO (98.9\\%), RoboTwin 2.0 (93.3\\%), and SimplerEnv-Bridge (87.3\\%).","authors":["Yicheng Liu","Zibin Dong","Baijun Ye","Tianyuan Yuan","Tao Jiang","Anqi Yang","Shicheng Cao","Haonan Liu","Yue Sun","Zihan Guo","Xiao Liu","Dong Ke","Changxun Pan","Chenru Wu","Tailai Cheng","Xiaoshu Ren","Xinlei Zhang","Jianning Cui","Zijie Zhao","Haoyu Zhang","Kaiming Xu","Haodong Yang","Bowen Zhang","Jiahui Niu","Shaoting Zhu","Shiduo Zhang","Hang Zhao"],"field_evidence":{"contribution":{"value":"统一自回归流输出推理与动作 token","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:41+00:00"},"routes":{"value":["R1","R5","R10"],"status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:41+00:00"},"institution":{"value":"星海图 Galaxea","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","quote":"","method":"human_review","checked_at":"2026-10-31T00:09:41+00:00"},"region":{"value":"国内","status":"human","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11739","q